sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Cluster Admin
    participant Deploy as deploy.sh
    participant OC as oc CLI
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API
    participant KfOp as KubeFlow Operator
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant AM as Alertmanager
    participant Services as RHOAI Services

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Admin,K8sAPI: Phase 1: Namespace & RBAC Setup
        Admin->>Deploy: Execute deploy.sh
        Deploy->>OC: Create namespace redhat-ods-applications
        OC->>K8sAPI: POST /api/v1/namespaces
        Deploy->>OC: Create namespace redhat-ods-monitoring
        OC->>K8sAPI: POST /api/v1/namespaces
        Deploy->>OC: Create namespace rhods-notebooks
        OC->>K8sAPI: POST /api/v1/namespaces
        Deploy->>OC: Apply pod security RBAC
        OC->>K8sAPI: Apply RoleBindings
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Deploy,K8sAPI: Phase 2: Stale CRD Cleanup & Dashboard ISVs
        Deploy->>OC: Delete stale CRDs
        OC->>K8sAPI: DELETE CRDs
        Deploy->>OC: Apply dashboard ISVs
        OC->>K8sAPI: Apply ISV resources
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Deploy,KfOp: Phase 3: KfDef Component Deployment
        Deploy->>OC: Apply KfDef: Dashboard
        OC->>K8sAPI: POST KfDef CR
        K8sAPI-->>KfOp: KfDef event
        KfOp->>K8sAPI: Reconcile Dashboard resources

        Deploy->>OC: Apply KfDef: Notebook Controller
        OC->>K8sAPI: POST KfDef CR
        K8sAPI-->>KfOp: KfDef event
        KfOp->>K8sAPI: Reconcile NBC resources

        Deploy->>OC: Apply KfDef: Model Mesh
        OC->>K8sAPI: POST KfDef CR
        K8sAPI-->>KfOp: KfDef event

        Deploy->>OC: Apply KfDef: DSPO
        OC->>K8sAPI: POST KfDef CR

        Deploy->>OC: Apply KfDef: Notebooks
        OC->>K8sAPI: POST KfDef CR

        Deploy->>OC: Apply KfDef: Monitoring
        OC->>K8sAPI: POST KfDef CR

        Deploy->>OC: Apply KfDef: Anaconda
        OC->>K8sAPI: POST KfDef CR
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 230)
        Note over Deploy,AM: Phase 4: Monitoring Stack
        alt OSD Managed Cluster
            Deploy->>OC: Configure PagerDuty secret
            Deploy->>OC: Configure DMS secret
            Deploy->>OC: Configure SMTP secret
        else Self-Managed Cluster
            Deploy->>OC: Create rhods-admins group
        end
        Deploy->>OC: Deploy Prometheus + Alertmanager
        OC->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment

        Note over Prom: Init container blocks until services healthy (~38min max)
        loop Health check (230 iterations x 10s)
            Prom->>Services: Check Dashboard:8443
            Prom->>Services: Check notebook-controller:8080
            Prom->>Services: Check model-controller:8080
            Prom->>Services: Check modelmesh:8080
            Prom->>Services: Check dspo:8080
            Services-->>Prom: Health status
        end
        Note over Prom: Init container passes, Prometheus starts

        loop Continuous scraping
            Prom->>Services: GET /metrics
            Services-->>Prom: Metrics data
        end
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over Deploy,K8sAPI: Phase 5: Final Configuration
        Deploy->>OC: Apply ConsoleLink
        OC->>K8sAPI: Create ConsoleLink
        Deploy->>OC: Apply OdhDashboardConfig
        OC->>K8sAPI: Create OdhDashboardConfig
        Deploy->>OC: Apply Network Policies
        OC->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicies
    end
